# Zenith engine texture usage declarations.
#
# WHAT THIS IS. Every source texture under this asset root, and what its bytes
# MEAN. The exporter reads it to choose a compression format and a colour space;
# a texture that is not listed here is NOT EXPORTED, and the tools boot names it.
#
# WHY IT EXISTS. This used to be inferred -- first "everything is BC1 linear",
# then "a basename containing 'normal' is BC5". The second inference was RIGHT
# about the bytes and still broke the game: the terrain normal maps duly became
# BC5, the two terrain G-buffer shaders still decoded three channels, blue read
# 0, the shading normal pointed into the ground, NdotL went to zero and the
# terrain silently stopped receiving any shadow at all. Nothing failed. The
# symptom arrived days later as "the houses stopped casting shadows onto the
# ground". An inference cannot be reviewed, cannot be diffed, and cannot be
# wrong out loud -- a declaration can be all three.
#
# THIS FILE IS COMMITTED even though `**/Assets/**` is gitignored: `.ztexdecl`
# is re-included by .gitignore exactly as `.zscen` and `.znavmesh` are. A
# declaration a fresh clone lacks is a declaration somebody re-guesses.
#
# FORMAT. One `<path> <USAGE>` per line; `#` comments; path is relative to this
# file, forward-slashed, matched case-insensitively.
#
#   BASE_COLOUR          displayed colour        -> BC1 sRGB (BC3 if it has alpha)
#   BASE_COLOUR_MASKED   + punch-through alpha   -> BC1_Alpha sRGB
#   NORMAL_MAP           tangent-space normal    -> BC5 linear, Z rebuilt at sample time
#   LINEAR_DATA          roughness/metal/AO/...  -> BC1 linear
#   UNCOMPRESSED_COLOUR  atlas/LUT, displayed    -> RGBA8 sRGB
#   UNCOMPRESSED_DATA    atlas/LUT, data         -> RGBA8 linear


# --- Textures/Cubemap ---
Textures/Cubemap/nx.png                                   BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Cubemap/ny.png                                   BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Cubemap/nz.png                                   BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Cubemap/px.png                                   BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Cubemap/py.png                                   BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Cubemap/pz.png                                   BASE_COLOUR

# --- Textures/Particles ---
Textures/Particles/particleSwirl.png                      BASE_COLOUR

# --- Textures/Terrain/Clay ---
Textures/Terrain/Clay/diffuse.jpg                         BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Terrain/Clay/normal.jpg                          NORMAL_MAP
Textures/Terrain/Clay/ao.jpg                              LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Clay/gloss.jpg                           LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Clay/height.jpg                          LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Clay/metallic.jpg                        LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Clay/reflection.jpg                      LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Clay/roughness.jpg                       LINEAR_DATA

# --- Textures/Terrain/Grass ---
Textures/Terrain/Grass/diffuse.jpg                        BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Terrain/Grass/normal.jpg                         NORMAL_MAP
Textures/Terrain/Grass/ao.jpg                             LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Grass/gloss.jpg                          LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Grass/height.jpg                         LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Grass/metallic.jpg                       LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Grass/reflection.jpg                     LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Grass/roughness.jpg                      LINEAR_DATA

# --- Textures/Terrain/Rock ---
Textures/Terrain/Rock/diffuse.jpg                         BASE_COLOUR
Textures/Terrain/Rock/normal.jpg                          NORMAL_MAP
Textures/Terrain/Rock/ao.jpg                              LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Rock/gloss.jpg                           LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Rock/height.jpg                          LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Rock/metallic.jpg                        LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Rock/reflection.jpg                      LINEAR_DATA
Textures/Terrain/Rock/roughness.jpg                       LINEAR_DATA

# --- Textures/Terrain/Grass ---
Textures/Terrain/Grass/grass_with_mud_and_stones_39_46.jpg  BASE_COLOUR

